type: dataset
title: "IBM Cloud Code Engine Traces"
abstract: >-
  Production traces from IBM Cloud Code Engine spanning 62 days, 1,780 applications,
  and more than 1.9 billion requests, including hashed application configurations
  (CPU/memory requests, container concurrency, minimum scale) and per-request
  invocation timestamps, execution times, and pod identifiers.
